			description: [
				"The &6Naquadah-doped Boule&r produces even more wafers per boule. It also is relatively cheap, due to the abundance of Naquadah that is gained from the &eTier 5 Microminer Mission&r."
				""
				"This boule also allows the production of &6Advanced System-on-Chip&r wafers."
