		{
			dependencies: ["28CA4E5308EC0BB9"]
			description: [
				"A complex material from &bThermal Expansion&r cooked in an &3Electric Blast Furnace&r, or an &2Alloy Blast Smelter&r."
				""
				"&6Enderium&r needs a lot of heat and is quite slow without overclocking. &2You can use small amounts of Krypton from Liquid Ender Air distillation to significantly decrease the smelting time.&r"
				""
				"&9Enderium also requires Tantalum, which can be renewably created by macerating and processing &6Dragon Scales&9.&r"
				""
				"As with all later blast furnace materials, it might be worth dedicating a furnace to keeping these in stock and having it running constantly to ensure a stable supply (turning it off when you have an acceptably vast stockpile)."
				""
				"In addition to its other uses, Enderium gets you access to &aResonant Integral Components&r for machines. These quests can be found on the &eProgression&r tab."
			]
			id: "7DB174443D7FAFA0"
