		{
			dependencies: ["424413BBCE3FD3BF"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"There are 3 materials you will need from processing &6Naquadah&r: &6Enriched Naquadah&r (Nq+), &6Naquadria&r (Nq*), and &6Trinium&r (Ke). "
				""
				"There are 2 different ways to process Naquadah, each resulting in different materials.&r"
				""
				"The first option is to process ores from the &6Tier Five Microminer&r. &6Naquadah Ore&r yields Nq+ (through the &3Magnetic Separator&r) and &6Kaemanite Ore&r yields Ke."
				""
				"The second option is to do the full processing of &6Naquadah Dust&r with &6Fluoroantimonic Acid&r. This is a decently involved process, but not only does it yield both other Nq materials, it also grants byproducts of &6Titanium, Sulfur, Indium, Phosphorus, Barium, and Gallium&r. "
			]
			icon: "gtceu:enriched_naquadah_dust"
