		{
			dependencies: [
				"28CA4E5308EC0BB9"
				"0508D3CCB6C876A3"
			]
			description: [
				"&2A strong heavy element obtained from the Naquadah chain."
				""
				"&6Trinium&r can come from &6Kaemanite Ore&r, but you will probably want to bolster its production with &6Naquadah Dust&r processing. It comes out at the second stage, so if you don't mind storing the intermediates and have Fluorine under control, you can hold off doing the full chain if you don't need to yet. You get &91 Trinium per 12 Naquadah processed&r."
				""
				"This will be required in large quantities for &6Trinium Coils&r, &6Superconducting Coil Blocks&r, and &6Naquadah Alloy&r, among other things. You will need almost 5.5 stacks for a &3Fusion Reactor MK I&r, so stock up on it!"
			]
			id: "15FAEE3F625265F4"
