		{
			dependencies: ["2BBAF93506DD79C1"]
			description: [
				"&aLasers&r are &9GregTech&r's native solution to high-volume power transfer. Each power tier starting at &9IV&r has &aLaser Hatches&r capable of transferring &9256A&r, &91,024A&r and &94,096A&r of their voltage's power!"
				""
				"Energy in the Laser Network flows from &aLaser Source Hatches&r through &6Laser Pipes&r to &aLaser Target Hatches&r. All these must be in a straight line - lasers don't bend, after all. Similarly to other power-related blocks, the tier of the &aLaser Target&r must not be lower than the tier of the &aLaser Source&r."
				""
				"It is recommended to use these when moving power between &3Active Transformers&r and your &3Power Substation&r, and as part of your &aPower Spine&r."
			]
