		{
			dependencies: ["52F1953ED72A8AA6"]
			description: [
				"Tier 4+ Microminer missions that require the &3Advanced Microverse Projector&r are quite taxing on the projected Microverse. As the recipes run, the Integrity of the microverse depletes. The total depletion a recipe causes can be seen in &bEMI&r."
				""
				"To combat this decay, &6Quantum Flux&r can be used to patch up the microverse. By placing the Flux in any input bus, it will be automatically consumed to repair the microverse, regardless of if a recipe is running. Each Flux repairs 1%%, and is only consumed if more than 1%% is missing."
				""
				"Note that the above behavior is specific to Normal microverses. &eEach microverse type repairs in different ways&r, so make sure to read their quests!"
				""
				"If a Microverse does reach 0 Integrity, it will collapse, and the microminer on the mission will be returned, but nothing else. You will have to project a new microverse to run more recipes."
				""
				"The stability of the microverse can be read out in the form of a redstone signal using the &6Microverse Stability Sensor Hatch&r."
			]
			icon: "monilabs:quantum_flux"
			id: "1EA5F30C5ACADBA9"
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			tasks: [{
				id: "3105E94F99354675"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Microverse Decay"
			x: 10.5d
			y: 7.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"0B9D5F865C3F8B31"
				"1349044BF8C04A12"
			]
			description: ["With a &3Tier Three Rocket&r you can make it to &eMercury&r and &eVenus&r. Before you go, make a &eNetherite Space Suit&r, otherwise the atmosphere will &cburn you to death&r.\n\nMercury has &6Argentite&r for &eIndium&r, &6Plutonium&r, and &6Laurite&r, as well as fluid veins of &9Blazing Pyrotheum&r, &9Sodium Persulfate&r, and... &9Mercury&r.\nVenus has &6Xenotime&r, &6Gallite&r, &9Sulfuric Acid&r fluid veins, and lots of &6Platinum Group ores&r."]
			id: "299CCE5C8C2219C8"
